{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Badminton</strong> brings the speed, precision, and energy of real-world badminton to life. Experience the fastest racket sport in the world like never before, in a realistic and accessible game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff8 REALISTIC GAMEPLAY &amp; PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic shuttle physics</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong>\u00a0<strong>player animations</strong> recreate the flow and intensity of real matches.\u00a0Expect a challenge that feels natural, with performance shaped by positioning, timing, and shot selection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 LOCAL MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singles or doubles with your friends.\u00a0Pure Badminton supports local <strong>multiplayer</strong> for <strong>up to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo allows you to play singles or doubles matches, alone or in multiplayer, in 2 of the available stadiums, with 4 available characters.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013610?t=1758236001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013610/04017a04812de7386de359b015efff229373bb77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758236001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013610/97b1d630d590952136525e09025965977bd2ae25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758236001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013610/97b1d630d590952136525e09025965977bd2ae25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758236001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Badminton</strong> brings the speed, precision, and energy of real-world badminton to life. Experience the fastest racket sport in the world like never before, in a realistic and accessible game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff8 REALISTIC GAMEPLAY &amp; PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic shuttle physics</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong>\u00a0<strong>player animations</strong> recreate the flow and intensity of real matches.\u00a0Expect a challenge that feels natural, with performance shaped by positioning, timing, and shot selection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 LOCAL MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singles or doubles with your friends.\u00a0Pure Badminton supports local <strong>multiplayer</strong> for <strong>up to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo allows you to play singles or doubles matches, alone or in multiplayer, in 2 of the available stadiums, with 4 available characters.</strong></p>","developers":["DS SOFT"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2591310","name":"Pure Badminton"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013610/4e85d52fc3cb6acaac03c264c88f757fef01a226/header.jpg?t=1758236001","is_f